# Rust build output
/target/
**/target/

# napi native addon: local dev build (copy-artifact.mjs) and CI-staged platform
# binaries. Rebuilt fresh by the publish workflow; also covered by
# promptsign-napi/.gitignore.
*.node

# Node deps for the napi package's JS glue / tests
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Pull request body written by scripts/watch-trust-root.mjs. It describes the
# commit rather than belonging to it, so it must never land in the tree.
/trust-root-pr-body.md

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Cargo.lock IS committed (reproducible builds) — do not ignore it.
